もに入れてください。\n\n背景はシンプルにベッドの上で\n服装は通常の服で（細部はだいたいで構いません）！\n\n服をきたまま、撫子はズボンを下げて、留美はスカートをめくりあげてしてる感じで！\n\n差分で2人とも帽子の有る無しが欲しいです！\n\n表情は2人とも照れている感じで、セックスしつつこっち振り向いている感じですかね\n\nおパンツは撫子は水色の、留美はオレンジのコットンおパンツでお願いします！\n\n画像サイズは縦3000ピクセル以上の大きな画像で、psdでお願いします！\n（差分はレイヤーで構いません）", "nc": 49, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 274000, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "みんくす🐻‍❄️告知用", "screen_name": "konyamoC", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036841138863349760/lnLyJ0Ug.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1553709793994743815/1667727000/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 722343, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "あるえ@skeb募集中", "screen_name": "buruburu2", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar/media.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2Fb93708ca-791f-4f84-9bb6-86a6bbf6d903.png?avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/2bd28c87-c9ef-4e64-92d2-6ce54ace0ac9.png", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 48}, {"id": 1138735, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "ゆめみせな☁️", "screen_name": "Sena_milk_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1624460739179331584/MhsrBdjZ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1262467710643957760/1768254671/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": 